        "## Operatori Booleeni (and, or, not)\n",
        "Avem, de asemenea, la dispozitia noastra si operatorii, **and**, **or**, si respectiv, **not**.\n",
        "\n",
        "Operatorul **and** verifica daca absolut toate expresiile comparate sunt adevarate."
      ],
      "id": "c3bab98d"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "(1 < 5) and (2 < 5)"
      ],
      "id": "801472fc",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "(1 < 5) and (2 < 5) and (10 < 5)"
      ],
      "id": "796b720d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Vedem ca e de ajuns ca o singura expresie sa fie falsa ca rezultatul sa fie fals.\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "Operatorul **or** verifica daca cel putin una dintre expresii este adevarata."
      ],
      "id": "dc5d6988"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "(1 == 2) or (2 == 2)"
      ],
      "id": "58f5d2f1",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Operatorul **not** neaga valoarea de adevar. Spre deosebire de **and** si **or**, **not** opereaza pe o singura expresie. Pur si simplu returneaza valoarea opusa."
      ],
      "id": "b6a290b6"
